188 (a) elect to receive a stipend for one to 10 days of additional work; or
189 (b) elect to not receive a stipend.
190 (6) A person who does not hold a full-time position as a special educator is eligible for a partial stipend
equal to the percentage of a full-time special educator position the person assumes.
